# oracle: YAFF MIL-53(Al) example, bonded terms only (bond harmonic, angle hybrid cosine/periodic cross harmonic cosine/squared, dihedral fourier, improper distharm), pair zero: the example's mm3 pair is not in the engine yet. NPT as in the example, 100 steps.
# measured 2026-10-13 (engine vs native, max relative error per value, no absolute floor): thermo 3.2e-12, per-atom 3.4e-9; the compare passes at rel 1e-8 abs 1e-10.
# oracle-inputs: w118yaff_mil53al_nopair.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           real
atom_style      full
boundary        p p p
dielectric      1
special_bonds   lj 0.000000 0.000000 1.000000 coul 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
pair_style      zero 12.0
bond_style      harmonic
angle_style     hybrid cosine/periodic cross harmonic cosine/squared
dihedral_style  fourier
improper_style  distharm
read_data       w118yaff_mil53al_nopair.data
pair_coeff      * *
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 2 delay 4 check yes
timestep        0.5
velocity        all create 0.0 5
fix             1 all npt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0 tri 2000.0 2000.0 1000.0 tchain 3 mtk yes nreset 1000
thermo_style    custom step etotal ke temp pe emol evdwl vol press
thermo_modify   format float %.15g norm no
thermo          50
run             100
